sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as API Client
    participant A as MyVanitys API

    C->>A: POST /products/{productId}/reviews  { rating, comment }  + Bearer token

    alt Token missing, invalid, or expired
        A-->>C: 401 ProblemDetail
    else Authorized
        alt Product does not exist
            A-->>C: 400 ProblemDetail (product not found)
        else Product exists
            alt Product is not in your vanity
                A-->>C: 500 ProblemDetail (generic server error)
                Note over C: Add the product to your vanity first.
            else Review added
                A-->>C: 202 ProductResponse (product with the new review)
            end
        end
    end
